<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Physics-Grounded Motion Forecasting via Equation Discovery for Trajectory-Guided Image-to-Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Related Work</span></a>
